      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BRAVE JET (5) will find this easier than his last start here 5 days ago when finishing sixth in a 7-horse field. He gets another crack at 1400m, and in an even contest, we put him on top at what should be a touch of value. ELEGANTLY WRITTEN (2) is a handy mare resuming from a spell with just the one trial under her belt. She normally needs a run, but has won 3 of her 4 starts here over this trip, so with that sort of record, she is worth keeping safe. GEE GEES ME BOY (1) may not win often, but his record is as consistent as they come. He handles any track conditions, and at this level, he is a top 4 chance again. I'M CHEV (7) has been below his best recently, and failed to fire here 2 weeks ago over 1600m. He drops 4.5kg, and in a small field, he gets one more chance from us. MONTEZULU (4) has yet to fire in 2 starts from a spell, but this is usually when he starts to find form. He is not the worst at a price.",
